<p>
Helper segment detail from OpenRoad <em>driver_routes</em>: loaded miles <strong>327.16</strong> + empty <strong>8.2</strong>;
revenue share recorded as <strong>$1,000</strong> (aligned with client payroll flat for that piece).
</p>

